v013-jev-decisions -> pnkit 0.1.0: the project-side changes (film/*.py), apply from the project root.

  python3 ~/videos/lib/tools/sync.py ~/videos/v013-jev-decisions      # vendors film/vendor/pnkit + pnkit.lock + vendor/__init__.py
  cd ~/videos/v013-jev-decisions && patch -p1 < v013-to-pnkit.diff
  python3 film/build.py && cmp film.scene.xml <the delivered film.scene.xml>   # byte-identical

Changed: lib.py (binds pnkit to the film's Doc, styles, palette and timeline; Cam subclass; physics wrappers),
brand.py (episode params + title-card emblem over pnkit.brand), captions.py (film_words + pnkit.captions,
WEAK + "queue"), shorts.py (Shorts list, subject, hook title over pnkit.shorts; keeps the unused hl-* asset),
emblems.py (rr = pnkit round_rect_d), styles.py and build.py (pnkit.brand.extend).

